# Walkthrough - Timetable Overflow Fix

I have fixed the issue where class slots in the timetable were expanding outside their allotted zones.

## Changes Made

### Frontend

#### [page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/timetable/page.tsx)
- Added `overflow-hidden` to class and event slot containers in both Horizontal and Vertical views.
- Implemented `line-clamp-2` (and `md:line-clamp-3`) for module names and event descriptions to ensure they elegantly truncate when space is limited.
- These changes ensure that even for short-duration slots (like 1-hour recitations), the content remains contained within the slot boundaries.

## Verification Results

### Visual Inspection
- Verified that slots now strictly respect their grid boundaries.
- Long text is now truncated with ellipses instead of bleeding into adjacent slots.
- Hover effects (scaling and depth) still function correctly within the new overflow constraints.
